<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - OpCo starts Finish Line.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - OpCo starts Finish Line.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co analyst Dorothy Lackner initiated coverage of Finish Line Inc with a buy rating and set a 12-month price target on the stock, a source at the brokerage said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst declined to comment immediately on the move.</p>
</text>
